 "main_html": "<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div>\n<div id=\"block-maryland-hero\">\n<section aria-labelledby=\"node-91-title\" class=\"maryland-hero maryland-hero--basic has-illustration no-image\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__content\">\n<div class=\"maryland-hero__breadcrumb\">\n<div class=\"maryland-breadcrumb__wrapper maryland-breadcrumb__wrapper--dark\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumbs\" class=\"usa-breadcrumb maryland-breadcrumb maryland-breadcrumb--dark\">\n<ol class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list maryland-breadcrumb__list\">\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/\">\n<span>Home</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization\">\n<span>Neighborhood Revitalization</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding\">\n<span>Community Development Funding</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item\">\n<a class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs\">\n<span>State Revitalization Programs</span>\n</a>\n</li>\n<li aria-current=\"page\" class=\"usa-breadcrumb__list-item maryland-breadcrumb__list-item usa-current\">\n<span class=\"usa-breadcrumb__link maryland-breadcrumb__link\">\n<span>Maryland Facade Improvement Program</span>\n</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"maryland-hero__title\" id=\"node-91-title\"><span>Maryland Facade Improvement Program</span>\n</h1>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hidden\" data-drupal-messages-fallback=\"\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"maryland-page-alerts margin-top-6\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-site-wide\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-9c9e28d008a737fca05184fe8589e7d8fd2c57bf93df8b8da95ab0fbf93c319b\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"views-element-container\" id=\"block-maryland-views-block-local-alerts-page-specific\">\n<div><div class=\"js-view-dom-id-9bbfbfa1028df672947d25d90e220c14910e3f8ebb07cd3466025f4de6072266\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-container\">\n<div class=\"grid-row grid-gap\">\n<aside class=\"layout-sidebar-first grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-3 margin-top-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15\" role=\"complementary\">\n<a class=\"usa-skipnav maryland-link maryland-link--skipnav\" href=\"#page-content\">Skip sidebar navigation</a>\n<nav aria-labelledby=\"sidenav-title\" class=\"maryland-sidenav\">\n<button aria-controls=\"sidenav\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__toggle\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"usa-sr-only\">Close</span>\n<h2 class=\"maryland-sidenav__title\" id=\"sidenav-title\">Section Menu</h2>\n</button>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-1\" id=\"sidenav\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-1\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-1\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/87\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs\">State Revitalization Programs</a>\n<ul class=\"maryland-sidenav__list maryland-sidenav__list--level-2\">\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/90\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs/baltimore-regional-neighborhood-initiative\">Baltimore Regional Neighborhood Initiative</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/96\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/reinvest-baltimore/baltimore-vacants-reinvestment-initiative\">Baltimore Vacants Reinvestment Initiative</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/88\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs/community-legacy-program\">Community Legacy Program</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\">Maryland Facade Improvement Program</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/93\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs/national-capital-strategic-economic-development-fund\">National Capital Strategic Economic Development Fund</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/89\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs/seed-community-development-anchor-institution-fund\">Seed Community Development Anchor Institution Fund</a>\n</li>\n<li class=\"maryland-sidenav__item maryland-sidenav__item--level-2\">\n<a class=\"maryland-sidenav__link maryland-sidenav__link--level-2\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/92\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs/strategic-demolition-fund\">Strategic Demolition Fund</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"margin-y-8 desktop:margin-top-10 desktop:margin-bottom-15 grid-col-12 desktop:grid-col-8\" id=\"page-content\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"maryland-toc-target\">\n<div class=\"usa-prose\">\n<div class=\"maryland-toc\">\n</div>\n<p>​​​​​​​​​​​​The Maryland Facade Improvement Program provides funding to improve the exteriors of businesses located in Maryland Sustainable Communities.</p><h2>Eligible applicants</h2><p>The following entities may apply for Maryland Facade Improvement Program funding for projects located in Sustainable Communities:</p><ul><li>​Local governments</li><li>Groups of local governments sharing a common purpose or goal</li><li>Community development organizations (for example: community development corporations, main street organizations, downtown partnerships)</li></ul><h2>Eligible projects</h2><p>Funds will be used for capital costs related to the improvement of exterior facades for business buildings and facilities.</p><p>The applicant will apply to capitalize a grants fund and develop an application process for businesses to improve their building facades.</p><p>Project should capitalize on the strengths of a community while addressing its challenges to revitalization and should help to achieve a local government’s Sustainable Communit​ies Action Plan.</p><h2>Eligible project locations</h2><p>Maryland Facade Improvement Program funding can only be used in areas known as <a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"cb86289b-450f-4487-ba7b-419a335bc256\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/sustainable-communities\" title=\"Sustainable Communities\">Sustainable Communities</a>. Sustainable Communities are geographic areas targeted for revitalization by local governments. To determine geographic eligibility, use the <a class=\"maryland-link\" href=\"https://experience.arcgis.com/experience/5f31da408b584e59abdc4930517cb05e\">Neighborhood Revitalization Mapper​</a>.</p><h2>Resources</h2><ul><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"5d62b557-070c-4eb1-bb06-8f357b61c9a5\" href=\"/media/660\" title=\"Maryland Facade Improvement Program Guidelines\">Maryland Facade Improvement Program Guidelines - Last Modified May 2025 - PDF - 225.97 KB</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"b229f0d3-c8ef-40ff-b3a8-6212b22eeed0\" href=\"/media/659\" title=\"Maryland Facade Improvement Program Sample Application\">Maryland Facade Improvement Program Sample Application​ - Last Modified May 2025 - PDF - 206.06 KB</a></li><li><a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"media\" data-entity-uuid=\"edbd6ffc-fcf0-4fb7-8bfb-2170f8146df1\" href=\"/media/658\" title=\"Maryland Facade Improvement Program FAQ\">Historic Preservation Compliance Frequently Asked Question (FAQ) - Last Modified May 2025 - PDF - 203.95 KB</a></li></ul><h2>More information</h2><p>For More Information and How to Apply, refer to the <a class=\"maryland-link\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"00ef7743-618c-4555-b654-e4e01c05bc96\" href=\"/neighborhood-revitalization/community-development-funding/state-revitalization-programs\" title=\"State Revitalization Programs\">State Revitalization Programs</a>​ webpage.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>"
